Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:44.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(重要建筑即将落成 伍德兰兹购物中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.71,0:38:35.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(一切才刚刚开始)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我迟到了 又停电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I'm late. The power's out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你一大早叫我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it that you called this extremely early morning meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带早餐的却是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet I'm the one bringing breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是个好人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're a good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:07.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实似乎如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evidence seems to go in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:14.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以后能每天早上见面吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we start meeting in the mornings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:17.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好让我给你带燕麦粥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I can bring you steel- cut oatmeal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问你为什么要见面吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ask you why we're meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好让你教我如何建东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can teach me how to build things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想成为建筑师吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to be an architect?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想确保那些墙不倒下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to make sure those walls stay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得它们会倒下吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think they could fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得可能被撞到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they could get knocked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是多年以后 我跟你一般年纪时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be years from now, could be when I'm your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一般年纪时我还会在啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll still be around when you're my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我跟你学点建筑知识也无妨嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it wouldn't hurt if I knew some of what you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:52.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何建墙 房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the walls, the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新建筑之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some new buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想长住？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're in it for the long haul?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在写什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:22.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢记下一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I write everything down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything of note.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:42.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在该你记了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有很多要记住的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gonna be a lot to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的一切才刚刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the beginning of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该记下一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should record all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:05:00.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我要教你的一切建筑知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along with everything I'm gonna teach you about building things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不用 谢谢 - 拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no, thank you. - Just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你必须保护自己 - 我又不用去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, you got to protect yourself. - Not if I don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大老远开车出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not driving all that way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了带着错误的垃圾回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can just drive back with the wrong shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一打这玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a dozen of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:50.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是哪家造的 外形都差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are consistent in appearance across manufacturers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:52.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会带对东西的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shit will be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会安装所谓的垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will install said shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后电网会重新运转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the grid will be fully operational again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:07.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你昨晚跟霍莉聊了聊 她是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard you talking to Holly last night. What's her story?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要问？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没什么原因 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No reason. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就随口一问 别逼我揍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an innocent question. Don't make me hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:15.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都带好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:18.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,急救箱 黄页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First aid kits, yellow pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦列出了清单 我发誓我们没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glenn made a checklist. We're good, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我只是喜欢担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I'm just a worrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才建起了那堵围住我们的墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how that wall wound up around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:26.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.35,0:06:31.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话应该我对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm supposed to be saying that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:33.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都带上了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 全好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - All set?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:39.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:42.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电网只是个雏形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power grid was a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能撑这么久才出问题我已经很意外了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised it took this long to start acting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:53.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会让它重新运转的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间不早了 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daylight's burning. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:04.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我之前说过 但是 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I said it before, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:19.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的 她是怎么回事啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, seriously, though, what's her story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒 又是一首混音歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, another mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're going die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以引走行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helps draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:58.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 也许有人不喜欢猫头鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe somebody doesn't like owls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:07.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有人进来搞了破坏吗？- 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Someone came in here and did this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里从没发生过这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuff like this never happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么敌人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you got any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有谁厌恶猫头鹰吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know anybody who hates owls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:38.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾这里没人能调查这种事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad there isn't somebody who could look into this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:41.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会四处问问的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:44.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 就算你找出了做这事的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so you find the person who did this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又能怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有某种后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:55.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听过"破窗理论"吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard about the Broken Window Theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:09:00.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归结起来就是 你保持窗户完整无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boils down to this... you keep the windows intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能保持社会稳定无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you keep society intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:05.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是猫头鹰不是窗户 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was an owl, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:11.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天总得干点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to do something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:19.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那边就是了吗？- 那就是仓库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it there? - That's the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去从那扇门进出是最快的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like that door is our fastest way in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:25.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先我们应该查看所有出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should know all the exits first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:26.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况有变 就有应变计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's a plan if things go south.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经有计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是"从前门出来"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called Going Out the Front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:34.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:41.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧你的准头啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you with the aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:48.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦说得没错 我们应该检查一下周边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glenn's right, we should do a perimeter check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查看出口 以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know our exits just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要提前声明 我不该来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're aware, I'm on record as stating that I should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:15.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道我不会战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You well know that I'm not combat ready
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至没有战斗的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or even for that matter combat inclined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船到桥头自然直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never are till you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得开始出力了 我就是这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you got to start pulling your weight. You know, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公平地说 我认为我出过力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All things being equal, I do believe my weight's been pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:31.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你们带到了华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you all to DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以鄙人之见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which, in this man's opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:35.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在如今的标准下 我已经救赎了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is damn near nirvana by current standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你没带我们来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except you didn't get us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:39.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们把你带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:41.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但假如不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But were it not for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提到这座城市有安家的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my mention of this city's potential for home and hearth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们中没有一个人有远见来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not a one of you would have had the vision to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:51.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更别提有胆量历尽千辛万苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let alone the cojones to travail such a fraught and punishing pilgrimage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.14,0:10:52.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是事实 妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that, sister, is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷冰冰的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's as cold and hard as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天 你真这么孬种吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you're really that much of a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:02.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我就是 我说过我是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am. I told you I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:13.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚准头不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was good aim back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:16.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打靶练习挺管用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target practice helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实上周我差点就拿艾登当靶子练了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, last week, I was pretty close to practicing on Aiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:41.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能从前门出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not getting out the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:57.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:02.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面可能有行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There could be some inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算里面有吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's say they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们行动 注意安全就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move. Let's be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 塔拉 - 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tara. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:46.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没问题吧？- 这条道交给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it? - I got this aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们被某物困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're stuck behind something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:17.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:22.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它们不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:30.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 安全 - 安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear. - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:02.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真有经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:04.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在外漂泊了很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were out there a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能还有更多行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There could be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:07.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开工吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:25.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 - 我们找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - We found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:50.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 又一个 - 好样的 尤金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's another. - All right, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:18.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它穿着防弹衣呢 让它走近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got armor. Let it come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:19.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾登 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aiden, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:53.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:58.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:05.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:15.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚？塔拉？尤金？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah? Tara? Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:21.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笼子开了 行尸出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cage is open. They're getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:27.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得去找… - 这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to find... - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还有呼吸吗？尤金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she breathing? Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离得太远 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I can't tell from right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:54.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金 你干掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eugene, it's yours. Take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那个办公室 我去救塔拉 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to that office. I'll get Tara. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:42.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:45.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没跟别人提枪的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't tell anybody about the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:47.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我发誓 - 回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I swear to God. - Answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有饼干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any more cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派对上你做的那些饼干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones you made for the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没了 赶快走 回家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gone. Now go. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家没电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My house doesn't have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来要去给猫头鹰雕像上色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to paint my owl statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:59.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有人把它打碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but somebody broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是无关紧要的小事 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these are problems, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎你家怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:06.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你的雕像也不感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about your statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:07.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能再做些饼干吗？- 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you make more cookies? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:13.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么不能？- 因为我不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - Because I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以教我怎么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe if you showed me how to make them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:17.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以自己做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I....I could do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要吃饼干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好 你得去奥利维亚那里偷巧克力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You're gonna have to steal the chocolate from Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:29.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要多给我偷一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you're gonna get an extra bar for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你被抓到了 把我供出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you get caught or you say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定对你不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not gonna like what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:33.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:40.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她怎么样了？- 她的头部受到重创\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's she doing? - She has serious head trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:43.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 失血过快 - 怎么才能止血？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's losing blood fast. - How do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,急救箱在艾登的背包里 已经被炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Med kit was in Aiden's pack. It got blown to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,货车里还有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another one in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:49.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她快不行了 我们得抬她过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on her way out. We need to get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我们抬她过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we'll get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命 来人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:54.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:58.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他还活着吗？- 我检查了 我以为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's alive? - I checked him. I... I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得去救他 - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've got to get him. - Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最少要三个人才能救下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna take at least three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有那么多时间吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got that kind of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算把艾登拉下来 他也可能伤重而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pull Aiden off there, we could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你想扔下他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're saying we leave him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会挺下来的 我知道她会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd do it. I know she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:13.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我留下陪她 保护她 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay with her. I'll keep her safe, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:18.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我们击退它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we'll knock them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还有信号弹吗？- 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still have that flare? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你朝那边的架子打信号弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fire the flare over the shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一部分行尸会被吸引过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll draw some of them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 剩下的我们徒手杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're gonna hit the rest hand to hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:29.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:35.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托宾真的认为这要花四周吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tobin really think this'll take four weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:02.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次围墙拓张 花了两倍的时间呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time they expanded the wall, it took 'em twice that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:09.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我顶会儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey you...you okay to hang tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:11.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去送份"急件"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to send a fax to Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:36.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家退到卡车里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, back till we're safe in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗辛怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Francine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:42.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:47.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:49.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:56.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up and in. You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:05.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:24.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 亚伯拉罕 - 当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Abraham. - Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:26.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你掩护外围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take out the ass end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.71,0:22:28.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对付面前这群丑八怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the uglies in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:30.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 排好队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Single file.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:31.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别害羞 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be shy. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:42.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 那家伙还活着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, son of a bitch is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在干什么 - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:46.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保他活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making sure he stays that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:54.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 我在喝啤酒呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rick, just having a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便送你一瓶 感谢你今天帮我老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I'd bring you one for helping my wife today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:22:59.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喝 但是很感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:02.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了 别告诉我你还没下班呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, don't tell me you're still on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远不能放松警惕 你懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of always am, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:07.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜的派对上除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at Deanna's party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:10.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.81,0:23:15.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那喝了酒 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had some, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望今天我能多帮些忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I wish I could have helped out more today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:23.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我四处问了问 但大家没发现什么异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked around, but nobody saor heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:27.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是只猫头鹰而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was just an owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.25,0:23:30.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于现在的情况 这不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grand scheme of things, I think we'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.83,0:23:33.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:38.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:40.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你妻子不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard you lost your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.99,0:23:51.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.89,0:23:56.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 看起来好像我们好像没失去过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure it looks like we haven't lost much,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:57.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们失去过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:23:59.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失去了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:04.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们非常努力地去保住剩下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other things we're just fighting like hell to hold on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.38,0:24:06.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们经历过那么多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you people have been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:08.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你们有没有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:11.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:19.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你的孩子们来体检吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring your kids in for a checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:22.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我让你来过 但他们也该来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I offered you one, but they really should come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在外面有一段时间了 是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were out there a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 谢谢 皮特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thanks, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交个朋友吧 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's be friends, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须做朋友 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kind of have to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.47,0:24:38.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.35,0:24:40.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:44.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回见 瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.89,0:25:04.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take no responsibility for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you what I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.62,0:25:10.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:13.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们所有人都应该听进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you, you should've listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.87,0:26:04.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 我们会救你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be okay. We're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:06.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.93,0:26:09.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须保持安静 好吗？能做到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stay quiet, okay? Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.25,0:26:11.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:13.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.79,0:26:18.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.85,0:26:19.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:20.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快熄灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's burning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.59,0:26:25.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:29.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们做不到的 - 我们肯定能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not gonna make this. - Hey, yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.25,0:26:31.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要你的帮助 你可以做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I need your help. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:33.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克 不 不要扔下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick. Nick, don't... don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.92,0:26:35.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.79,0:26:38.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 好的 - 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Okay. - Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.28,0:26:55.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你扔下了他们 我们都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left them. We both did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:27:00.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:02.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.05,0:27:03.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:13.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it was... it was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.93,0:27:15.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前的其他人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The others before...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:18.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有惊慌 是我们惊慌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't panic. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:24.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.91,0:27:25.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.74,0:27:55.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是这么干的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That how it works with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.39,0:27:58.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弃他人于不顾 让人等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You leave people behind to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:01.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一套规矩 告诉他 弗兰辛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a system. Tell him, Francine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.05,0:28:01.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.77,0:28:05.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.86,0:28:09.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么大动静会吸引更多行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, all that noise is bound to draw more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.84,0:28:12.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天到此为止 明早再来 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we call it and start fresh in the morning, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:14.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的 弗兰辛 你可以继续吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw that. Francine, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:18.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离天黑至少还有三个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got at least three hours of daylight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.82,0:28:23.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要两个望风的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want two lookouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.63,0:28:25.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人在铲斗里 一个人在卡车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One in the bucket and one on the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.33,0:28:27.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果更多的行尸向我们袭来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should give us more than enough warning
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.69,0:28:29.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能得到足够的预警了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if more are coming after the bash and pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.75,0:28:33.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍拍你们屁股上的蜘蛛网 给我动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now pull the cobwebs out of your ass and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:37.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得盖一堵墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a wall to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:44.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯 站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholas, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.95,0:28:48.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你冲不出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.04,0:28:52.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:28:59.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:00.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你请辞我们很遗憾 托宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to lose you, Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:19.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定吗？- 我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.41,0:29:22.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果亚伯拉罕听从了我的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Abraham had followed my orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.23,0:29:24.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.59,0:29:27.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说他因救人而成为英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, saving someone's life makes them a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:31.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但并不意味着他有足够的资质管理施工人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it doesn't qualify them to run a construction crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.71,0:29:33.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们依然在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're still out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:36.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个团队依旧在工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still working, the whole team.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带领着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's leading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.80,0:29:43.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我以前强多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than I ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:54.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:29:59.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕回来之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll speak to Abraham
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.09,0:30:00.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他谈谈 正式任命他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he's back and make it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:02.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:06.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 迪安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.48,0:30:09.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:12.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不会后悔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.81,0:30:39.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的没错 你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:41.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕的能力绝对足以胜任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abraham's more than qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.53,0:30:50.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你团队的另一个人手握大权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put another one of your people in a position of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.90,0:30:52.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为他们做担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you vouch for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:55.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已经变成惯例了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's becoming a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.96,0:30:57.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道自己在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:00.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你把我们留在这里的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why you wanted us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.25,0:31:05.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是亚伦和达里尔在外面寻找更多的人的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's why Aaron and Daryl are out there looking for more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.18,0:31:07.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望有个未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.42,0:31:10.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我们与你共创未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need us for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.53,0:31:13.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.31,0:31:18.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我继续去写耕地计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go get back to work on those field plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.89,0:31:21.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我随后就来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be down in a minute. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:39.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些烤好后就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After these are done, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.88,0:31:41.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再帮你了 你也不要再来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not helping you again and you're not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:46.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你没想要带走一半多的饼干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're not expecting to leave with more than half of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:47.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才干了那么点活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You barely did half the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:52.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前是个好厨师吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you always a good cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.54,0:31:57.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我们不要说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, we're not talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.44,0:32:02.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擦台面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wipe the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:08.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢做菜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you like it? Cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.86,0:32:11.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.19,0:32:15.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必交朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要不沉默就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just doesn't have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:24.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前很会做菜 那能分散我的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was good at it. It distracted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.77,0:32:26.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我忘记我的伤心事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It made me forget when I was sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.47,0:32:30.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我伤心的时候 会砸东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes when I get sad, I break stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.65,0:32:32.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.07,0:32:40.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说有人砸了你的猫头鹰雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said somebody broke your owl statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.18,0:32:41.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己砸的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.76,0:32:48.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.37,0:32:51.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么来这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:56.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要偷枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you steal the guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.66,0:33:01.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有时你得保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because sometimes you need to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.97,0:33:09.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我一把吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:12.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么想要枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.28,0:33:16.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.89,0:33:20.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是为了谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.13,0:33:25.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 是为了谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, who's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.11,0:33:34.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.65,0:33:47.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以杀出一条血路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, maybe... maybe we can shoot our way past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.28,0:33:50.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们还有枪 - 弹药在你那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys still have guns. - And you have the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.51,0:33:52.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得想点办法 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to do something, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.67,0:33:53.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会死在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna die in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:59.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有别的办法 一定有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be another way. There was to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.51,0:34:08.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.09,0:34:10.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来咬我呀 来咬我呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come get me. Come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.99,0:34:14.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.52,0:34:16.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来咬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.23,0:34:28.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油 尤金 就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Eugene. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.23,0:34:42.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.56,0:34:45.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们俩 听我说 尼古拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you both... hey, Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:48.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们俩一起稳住门 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you both to keep the door steady, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.01,0:34:49.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来砸玻璃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna break the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.80,0:34:53.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一出去 你就推出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get out, you push out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:54.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到枪就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get the rifle and we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.71,0:34:55.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:56.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:05.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 住手 这样不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, stop! It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.74,0:35:08.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 只能这样 - 不 砸不破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is the only way. - No, it's not gonna break.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.86,0:35:11.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会的 我们稳得住 可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will. We can hold it. We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.64,0:35:14.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我好吗？数到三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, okay? Count of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.80,0:35:17.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数到三 一 二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Count of three. One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.69,0:35:20.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:25.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼古拉斯 尼古拉斯 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicholas! Nicholas, don't! Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.15,0:35:28.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 该死 尼古拉斯 别这样 - 尼古拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn it, Nicholas, no! - Nicholas!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.69,0:35:36.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 别放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.80,0:35:46.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 诺亚 诺亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah! Noah! Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:50.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.96,0:36:36.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move over. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:43.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回车上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back in the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:44.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你告诉我他们在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until you tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.99,0:36:48.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么跟我一起回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either you come back with me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.17,0:36:50.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么留在这里陪你朋友一起死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you stay here and you die with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.93,0:36:52.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由你决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are your choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我把他关到后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me get him in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.22,0:37:23.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 是卡萝尔对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Carol, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.03,0:37:46.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:50.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:51.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉不适吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.94,0:37:54.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前跟山姆在一起 他没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was with Sam earlier. Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.65,0:37:58.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能有什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:04.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和杰茜谈谈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I talk to Jessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.62,0:38:05.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:08.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.99,0:38:46.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加百利 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gabriel, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.11,0:38:48.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:49.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 进来吧 - 私下谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come... come in. - Privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:50.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.51,0:38:59.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satan...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.87,0:39:03.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以天使之光伪装自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he disguises himself as the angel of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.91,0:39:09.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心虚假之光已经进入了墙内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that false light is here inside these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.50,0:39:14.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你的社区不是天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your community, you say it's not a paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:15.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这里就是天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.51,0:39:19.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能来到这里我很感激 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm grateful to be here. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:23.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你让其他人进来是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you made a mistake letting in the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:25.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.79,0:39:28.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick...
