Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.84,0:39:36.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're not good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.72,0:39:39.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们做过一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:44.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们做过坏透了的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've done unspeakable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:52.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特在打杰茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete's hitting Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.91,0:39:56.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许也打了山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Sam, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:01.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像他们那样在外面生存那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make it out there as long as they did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.83,0:40:03.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须做一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they must have done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:04.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克自己也说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick said as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们生存了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.19,0:40:10.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what makes them assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.86,0:40:12.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.76,0:40:14.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能信任他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.30,0:40:16.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:20.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许以为他们做那些事是身不由己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may believe that they did what they had to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.62,0:40:23.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很害怕 所以他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they were afraid and so they...
