Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:28.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 总有一天 - 我们今天进展很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The day will come... - We made a damn good dent today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.91,0:40:32.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把自己的性命放在你们之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they'll put their own lives before yours and everyone else's
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.35,0:40:35.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后摧毁你们这里的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they will destroy everything you have here,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.77,0:40:38.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁你们努力建立的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything you're working so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.26,0:40:39.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你们早点睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you all call it an early night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this how?
