Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.26,0:40:47.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不用说我也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.48,0:40:51.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么现在才告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you just now coming to me with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satan,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.24,0:40:57.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以天使之光伪装自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he disguises himself as the angel of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.17,0:41:02.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的仆人是正义的假使徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His servants are the false apostles of righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.28,0:41:05.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不配来这里 他们不配来天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't deserve this. They don't deserve paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:11.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 加百列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.75,0:41:15.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.32,0:41:19.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.73,0:41:24.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望自己能早点来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wish I'd come to you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.79,0:41:26.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.93,0:41:32.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望不算太迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope it isn't too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.02,0:41:49.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊 我需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.06,0:41:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:58.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道该怎么处理皮特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how this is gonna go with Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:03.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一种办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way it can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:14.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to kill him.
